{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-none-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:30:53.933Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"fadf9ad971eaac081e8a6505ab1a6e51a8193a11aebf49234941e25a82e83714","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here is what Moss's Strategic digests show. Two of the four owners are inferred, because the digests often say \"Gideon's account\" instead of naming the company.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account and moved to Gideon on **Monday, 2026-05-04**. The 5/3 digest says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 5/4\", and the 5/4 digest says it was reassigned that day. Neither names Gideon. The 8/3 digest calls Vantorre Group \"Gideon's biggest account\", which is how I got his name.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The digests have called it \"Gideon's fleet account\" since July 2025. The 5/4 digest says he \"also assumed management\" of it that day, which sits oddly with those earlier mentions. If the slide needs a date for Mobility, check the CRM.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, inferred. The digests from 12/2025 and 9/2026 refer to \"Gideon's medical account\", and Orlavine is the only medical account listed. The 3/2025 digest had it as Nadia's, and the 9/2025 digest mentions an account Gideon took over in August 2025. That is probably Orlavine, but it isn't named.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I can't confirm an owner. The digests only call it \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account\" and never name a person. Please check the CRM or ask the pod.\n\nPlease confirm Orlavine and Quillfeather with Gideon or Nadia before they go on the board slide."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
